:: Prison Pill Storage
    <<effects>><<generate_anxious_guard 0>>

    As <<anxious_guard 0>><<person1>> turns <<his>> attention to the monitors, you take that chance and slip into the storage room.
    <br><br>

    Inside, the cabinets present what looks like hundreds and hundreds of tiny numbered drawers, that seem to correspond to prisoner numbers. Awfully aware of the brief window afforded to you in this restricted room, you peek inside one of the drawers, to discover a tiny box containing a pill.
    <br><br>

    Some quick thinking leads you to believe these might be each prisoner's Choice Reversal pill.
    <br><br>

    <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>>
    <<link [[Search for your pill|Prison Pill Storage Search]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty 500>>
    <br>
    <<link [[Leave|Prison Spire]]>><</link>>
    <br>

:: Prison Pill Storage Search
    <<effects>>

    You try your best to search both quickly and stealthily while you still have some time remaining.

    <<skulduggerycheck>>
    <<if $skulduggerysuccess>>
        <<set _variant to $player.gender is "m"?"(F)":"(M)">>

        And in a daring strike of luck, you manage to find your cabinet; and with it, the box housing your pill. 
        | <span class="blue">+1 Choice Reversal pill</span>
        <<set $sexStats.pills["pills"]["X-Change Choice Reversal "+_variant].owned++>>
        <<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
        <<set $xchange.prisonPill to 0>>
        <br><br>

        You pocket the pill in one swift motion, and quickly head out before you're found out.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Leave|Prison Spire]]>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        However, as you look through row after row of cabinets, seeking that which would contain your pill, <<anxious_guard 0>> comes into the room searching for you.
        <br><br>

        You're caught redhanded in your frantic quest. "You just couldn't keep your nose clean, huh?" <<he>> says as <<he>> grabs you forcefully. "Looks like you'll be coming with me."
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Prison Punishment]]>>
    <</if>>